  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Racionalizacin de los Consumos de Agua Potable (PRAC)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Consumption Efficiency Program (PRAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El propsito del programa es promover e inducir el uso racional del agua (manejo de la demanda), a fin de aumentar la cobertura y mejorar la calidad del servicio de agua potable (calidad, presin y continuidad) en la misma rea geogrfica de intervencin zona o reaszonas aledaas con servicio deficiente.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the program is to promote and encourage efficient water use (demand management) in an effort to increase coverage and enhance the quality of water service (quality, pressure, and continuity) in the same geographic area of intervention or neighboring areas with inadequate service.</narrative>
  </description>
